## Mandated Constraints
- **One Task at a Time**: Work sequentially. Do not perform parallel edits across files.
- **Small Changes**: Maximum 5 files per completion cycle. Changes must be atomic.
- **No Documentation Deletion**: Never delete documentation. Use `~~strikethrough~~` for deprecated items.
- **Triple Pass Protocol**: Run all planning/error resolution through the Triple Pass Protocol inside `tasks/plan.md` before writing code.
- **Quality Gates**: Every edit must pass `npm run lint` and `npx tsc --noEmit` with zero warnings/errors.
